 "text": "Hey, how are you doing? That's fine. You can cook the tents now, they just need to warm through. Do you want to put them in the oven or over a fire? Oven is gentler if you can go slow. A fire is faster but the sticks might burn. It will shift and twist a bit, but it' fairly stable. Just keep an eye on it. They probably just bored. You could pop in the tent steaks now or wait until the dinner part. Okay, just let her have her moment. We can finish with the tents when the fire's ready.",
